### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

?? status == 200
?? header content-type includes application/json
?? body status == ok

### Query parameters and JSON arrays
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?role=reader
Accept: application/json

?? status == 200
?? body users isArray
?? js response.parsedBody.users.length == 2
?? body users[0].name == Ada
?? body users[0].role == reader
?? body users[1].role == reader

### Create a user with a JSON request body
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Grace",
  "role": "reader"
}

?? status == 201
?? header location == /api/users/43
?? body id == 43
?? body name == Grace
?? body role == reader

### Delete with an empty response
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/43

?? status == 204
?? js response.body.length == 0

### Plain text response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/greeting

?? status == 200
?? header content-type includes text/plain
?? body == Hello from WireMock!

### An expected not-found response is a passing test
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/999

?? status == 404
?? body error == user_not_found
